<!DOCTYPE html>
<!--
  Variants index for {{PROJECT_NAME}} — the comparison page from step 3 of the
  UX track three-step order (ux-track.md §3.3 + §7).

  Lists every variant produced in step 3 with a short fingerprint description
  (what makes each visually distinct: typography, density, motion). After the
  user picks a canonical variant, this page is rewritten by Phase A scrub
  (ux-track.md §9) to show only the canonical pick + fallback (if any) +
  link to palette-options.html (the decision rationale) + link to _archive/
  for historical reference.

  Replace {{PROJECT_NAME}}, {{MODULE_NAME}}, and the variant cards. Add or
  remove cards as needed for your N variants.
-->
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>{{PROJECT_NAME}} — UX variants ({{MODULE_NAME}})</title>
<style>
* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
body { font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; padding: 32px; max-width: 880px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.55; color: #18181b; }
h1 { font-size: 26px; margin-bottom: 6px; letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
p.lede { color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; max-width: 640px; }
.note { background: #f5f4f0; border-left: 3px solid #2E8B85; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 4px; margin: 18px 0 24px; font-size: 13px; color: #52525b; }
.note code { background: #ecebe6; padding: 1px 5px; border-radius: 3px; font-size: 12px; }
.grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 22px; }
.card { border: 1px solid #e4e4e7; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px 20px; transition: all 150ms; background: #fff; }
